config MR75203
	bool "Moortec MR75203 PVT monitor"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_MOORTEC_MR75203_ENABLED && COUNTER
	help
	  Read the temperature and voltage channels of the MR75203 PVT monitor.
	  Serial converter transactions use a hardware counter for bounded polling.
